All 37 panels/states/strings render from the bound @Observable LiveLogsPageModel + the Localizable.xcstrings
catalog. Web key names preserved verbatim (translation.liveLogs.* mirror). The single declared live data source
(useLogStream) implements empty + success (the manifest's two declared states) inside GlassPanel4, plus the
connection's loading(connecting badge) / error(GlassPanel3 + error badge) / paused states surfaced by the controls
badge — every reachable connection state of the source is rendered. The live SSE is subscribed via the view's
